Description: list of source packages to build with LTO by default
 The source packages listed here are the only ones built with link
 time optimization (LTO) by the dpkg vendor build feature
 optimize/lto; packages not listed are built without LTO unless
 their own packaging opts in explicitly. Consulted by
 Dpkg::Vendor::Debian at build time; dpkg-dev depends on this
 package.
 .
 Initial entries: the 619 source packages of the update-lto-20260910
 rebuild campaign (deepin-community project 818) with a merged
 "Rebuild with LTO enabled" pull request, enabled on all supported
 architectures (amd64 / arm64 / sw64 / loong64).
